TEXT-TO-SPEECH PROJECT INSTALLATION LIST

PROJECT:
AI Text-to-Audio Generator

SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS:
- Windows 10 or Windows 11
- Python 3.11 recommended
- Node.js LTS
- FFmpeg
- espeak-ng
- Internet connection for first Kokoro model download

IMPORTANT:
Use Python 3.11, not Python 3.13.

==================================================
1. INSTALL SYSTEM SOFTWARE
==================================================

Install Python 3.11:

winget install Python.Python.3.11

Check Python:

py -3.11 --version

Install Node.js LTS:

winget install OpenJS.NodeJS.LTS

Check Node.js:

node --version
npm --version

Install FFmpeg:

winget install Gyan.FFmpeg

Check FFmpeg:

ffmpeg -version
where.exe ffmpeg

Install espeak-ng:

winget install eSpeak-NG.eSpeak-NG

Check espeak-ng:

espeak-ng --version

