==================================================
5. IMPORTANT NOTES
==================================================

If pip is not recognized, use:

python -m pip install -r requirements.txt

If Kokoro install fails, check Python version:

python --version

Use Python 3.11.

If backend says port 8000 is already used:

netstat -ano | findstr :8000

Then kill the PID:

taskkill /PID YOUR_PID_HERE /F

If frontend shows CORS error, add frontend port to backend CORS:

http://127.0.0.1:5173
http://localhost:5173
http://127.0.0.1:5174
http://localhost:5174

If MP3 export fails, FFmpeg is not detected. Use WAV or fix FFmpeg PATH.

If FFmpeg is installed by Winget, path may look like:

